  book_title: "Story Time, Issue 10 \u2014 Late May 2000"
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: -1
  content: "15 Jokes:\nThe Power of Prayer\nTom complained to a friend, \u201CWhat
    good is prayer? My son wants a bicycle for Christmas, but I can\u2019t afford
    one. I prayed all night, and there\u2019s still no bicycle!\u201D\n\u201CYou\u2019re
    going about it the wrong way,\u201D his friend said. \u201CSteal a bicycle for
    your son first. Then pray for forgiveness.\u201D\n\n"
